		<div class="mb-2 font-mono text-xs text-foreground-muted">градиенты, max={'{300}'}</div>
		<RadialChart data={browserData} config={browserGradientConfig} dataKey="visitors" nameKey="browser" max={300} barSize={10} class="h-[280px] w-full" />
	</div>
</div>

```svelte
<RadialChart {data} {config} dataKey="visitors" nameKey="browser" variant="semi" legend />
<RadialChart {data} {config} dataKey="visitors" nameKey="browser" max={300} barSize={10} />
```

## В markdown

````markdown
:::chart
[type]radial
[title]Выполнение плана
[max]100

| Команда   | Процент |
|-----------|---------|
| Backend   | 82      |
| Frontend  | 64      |
| Mobile    | 47      |
:::
````

:::chart
